// result_end
\caption(Held-out BYOL alignment, feature spread and matching-crop retrieval.)
\alttext(Three plots show held-out squared alignment loss, target feature spread and matching-crop retrieval by epoch.)

On this fixture, held-out alignment improved and the final representation
retrieved more positive pairs than at initialization. Average feature spread
fell modestly over the same updates.

> Reference

- [Grill et al. (2020), Bootstrap Your Own Latent](https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.07733).
